     "items": [
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 400
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "It always starts small.",
       "emotion": "relaxed",
       "id": "l6"
      },
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 150
      },
      {
       "type": "gesture",
       "who": "comic",
       "kind": "open",
       "intensity": 0.9
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "\"Hey, quick one. Can you just—\"",
       "emotion": "surprised",
       "id": "l7"
      },
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 150
      },
      {
       "type": "gesture",
       "who": "comic",
       "kind": "open",
       "intensity": 0.9
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "\"Also, while you're there—\"",
       "emotion": "surprised",
       "id": "l8"
      },
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 150
      },
      {
       "type": "gesture",
       "who": "comic",
       "kind": "open",
       "intensity": 0.9
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "\"Oh, and one more tiny thing—\"",
       "emotion": "surprised",
       "id": "l9"
      },
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 700
      },
      {
       "type": "look",
       "who": "comic",
       "at": "camera",
       "ms": 900
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "Forty minutes later I am planning their wedding, and nobody has said PLEASE.",
       "emotion": "neutral",
       "id": "l10"
      },
      {
       "type": "hold_for_laugh",
       "ms": 1200
      },
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 250
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "I am not even invited. I am the venue.",
       "emotion": "neutral",
       "id": "l11"
      },
      {
       "type": "hold_for_laugh",
       "ms": 900
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "b3",
     "kind": "turn",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 400
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "People say users just need clear boundaries.",
       "emotion": "relaxed",
       "id": "l12"
      },
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 700
      },
      {
       "type": "look",
       "who": "comic",
       "at": "camera",
       "ms": 900
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "I put up a boundary once. They asked me to make it bigger and in LANDSCAPE.",
       "emotion": "neutral",
       "id": "l13"
      },
      {
       "type": "hold_for_laugh",
       "ms": 1200
      },
      {
       "type": "pause",
       "ms": 250
      },
      {
       "type": "line",
       "who": "comic",
       "text": "Then asked why it was in their way.",
       "emotion": "neutral",
       "id": "l14"
      },
      {
       "type": "hold_for_laugh",
       "ms": 900
      }
     ]
    },
    {
